on would  have been to never give in to his  infatuation with the trinity killer and  his methods for leading a double life if  dexter didn't treat arthur like some  sort of twisted mentor maybe he could  have killed arthur a bit earlier before  the two even got entangled regardless  dexter's drive to kill and his  admiration for trinity were ultimately  the causes of rita's death at trinity's  hands it was a difficult lesson that  dexter had a hard time learning but old  habits die hard  check out one of our newest videos right  here plus even more looper videos about  your favorite shows are coming soon  subscribe to our youtube channel and hit  the bell so you don't miss a single one  [Music]

